      "text": "$ oc login -u admin -p redhatocp https://api.ocp4.example.com:6443\n$ oc get template -n redhat-ods-applications\n\n$ oc get template/... -n redhat-ods-applications -o yaml | less\n$ oc get template/... -n redhat-ods-applications -o yaml | grep -E '...|...'",
