      "text": "--> Model must reside on shared storage (e.g. S3, ... )\n\n--> Create an                    to serve the model :\n        ° The main interface Kserve / ModelMesh uses\n          for managing models\n\n--> Check the status of your\n        ° Pods that correspond to a particular \n          are started only when an InferenceService requires it",
